    "body": "The `end-of-file-fixer` exclude list is now special-casing `mcountinhibit.yaml`. Since this CSR YAML is auto-generated from `spec/std/isa/csr/Zicntr/mcountinhibit.layout` (see file header), excluding just this one file is brittle and will be easy to forget for other generated CSR YAMLs. Prefer either (a) fixing the generator/layout output so it passes `end-of-file-fixer`, or (b) excluding generated CSR YAMLs by a broader, path-based pattern (e.g. the generated CSR output directories) rather than a single filename.\n",
